msgid "Regular expression (long-press for help)"
msgstr "Vanligt uttryck (långt tryck för hjälp)"

#: frontend/apps/reader/modules/readersearch.lua:80
msgid ""
"Regular expressions allow you to search for a matching pattern in a text. "
"The simplest pattern is a simple sequence of characters, such as `James "
"Bond`. There are many different varieties of regular expressions, but we "
"support the ECMAScript syntax. The basics will be explained below.\n"
"\n"
"If you want to search for all occurrences of 'Mister Moore', 'Sir Moore' or "
"'Alfons Moore' but not for 'Lady Moore'.\n"
"Enter 'Mister Moore|Sir Moore|Alfons Moore'.\n"
"\n"
"If your search contains a special character from ^$.*+?()[]{}|\\/ you have "
"to put a \\ before that character.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"Words containing 'os' -> '[^ ]+os[^ ]+'\n"
"Any single character '.' -> 'r.nge'\n"
"Any characters '.*' -> 'J.*s'\n"
"Numbers -> '[0-9]+'\n"
"Character range -> '[a-f]'\n"
"Not a space -> '[^ ]'\n"
"A word -> '[^ ]*[^ ]'\n"
"Last word in a sentence -> '[^ ]*\\.'\n"
"\n"
"Complex expressions may lead to an extremely long search time, in which case "
"not all matches will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Med reguljära uttryck kan du söka efter ett mönster i en text. Det enklaste "
"mönstret är en vanlig teckenföljd, till exempel `James Bond`. Det finns "
"många varianter av reguljära uttryck, men KOReader stöder ECMAScript-"
"syntaxen. Grunderna förklaras nedan.\n"
"\n"
"Om du vill söka efter alla förekomster av 'Mister Moore', 'Sir Moore' eller "
"'Alfons Moore', men inte 'Lady Moore', anger du 'Mister Moore|Sir "
"Moore|Alfons Moore'.\n"
"\n"
"Om sökningen innehåller något av specialtecknen ^$.*+?()[]{}|\\/ måste du "
"sätta ett \\ före tecknet.\n"
"\n"
"Exempel:\n"
"Ord som innehåller 'os' -> '[^ ]+os[^ ]+'\n"
"Ett valfritt tecken '.' -> 'r.nge'\n"
"Valfria tecken '.*' -> 'J.*s'\n"
"Siffror -> '[0-9]+'\n"
"Teckenintervall -> '[a-f]'\n"
"Inte ett blanksteg -> '[^ ]'\n"
"Ett ord -> '[^ ]*[^ ]'\n"
"Sista ordet i en mening -> '[^ ]*\\.'\n"
"\n"
"Komplexa uttryck kan medföra en mycket lång söktid. I så fall visas kanske "
"inte alla träffar."

