#: plugins/gestures.koplugin/main.lua:661
msgid ""
"The rate is how often screen will be refreshed per second while selecting "
"text.\n"
"Higher values mean faster screen updates, but also use more CPU."
msgstr ""
"Frekvensen anger hur ofta skärmen uppdateras per sekund när text markeras.\n"
"Högre värden ger snabbare skärmuppdateringar men använder också mer "
"processorkraft."

